      "message": "test(ui): shipped theme example checks untouched fields against DARK\n\nthe_shipped_example_parses pinned two untouched fields to literal numbers\nthat went stale when the dark column moved: cell_h (35 -> 40, #767) and\nfont_row_suffix (10.5 -> 11.5). Both now read Tokens::DARK, so the check\nfollows the dark column instead of a copied number.\n\nFixes #932\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
